  "description": "A deterministic, purely functional simulation of a POSIX process: filesystem, file descriptors, sockets, signals, and the Unix platform profile. No I/O and no host reads, so a replay never depends on the machine that produced it. From 1.0, a new case in any union whose cases are public is a major version. A call the model does not cover throws UnmodelledException, and a minor version may add or remove the places that do.",
